  "question": {
    "text": "A transverse sinusoidal wave moves along a string in the positive $x$-direction at a speed of $10 \\mathrm{~cm} / \\mathrm{s}$. The wavelength of the wave is $0.5 \\mathrm{~m}$ and its amplitude is $10 \\mathrm{~cm}$. At a particular time $t$, the snap-shot of the wave is shown in figure. The velocity of point $P$ when its displacement is $5 \\mathrm{~cm}$ is\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/mhi0oq-_KYK-esNT29R9yjrzmdQ4wioIwrP6eQjavKg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "LsVQZ",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{50} \\hat{\\mathbf{j}} \\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "LXepi",
      "text": "\n$-\\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{50} \\hat{j} \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "YtgE5",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{50} \\hat{\\mathbf{i}} \\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "G3a3t",
      "text": "\n$-\\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{50} \\hat{\\mathbf{i}} \\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
      "image": null,
