  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Particle velocity $v_p=-v$ (slope of $y-x$ graph)\nHere,$v=+v e$, as the wave is travelling in positive $x$-direction.\nSlope at $P$ is negative.\n$\\therefore$ Velocity of particle is in positive $y(+\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{j}})$ direction.\n$\\therefore$ correct option is (a).",
    "image": null
